# Mintaka — page copy, Tajik (literary Tajik in Cyrillic: ғ ӣ қ ӯ ҳ ҷ; no ц щ ы ь).
# A draft translation of content/en/page.ftl (the source) by Claude, made at the founder's
# request on 2026-10-30. Native speakers should review it before launch: docs/TRANSLATION.md has
# the glossary, the conventions and the lines to check first.
# Inline syntax understood by the generator: `code` and **strong**.
# Rule: no invented numbers. Numbers on the page are measured live or computed from a cited source.
# Typography: «» quotes; a no-break space before every spaced dash and between a number and its
# unit. A noun after a numeral stays singular (5 дархост), so counts rarely need a selector.

